        {
          "text": "Tabs"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "8f25626f1b97",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "To create a tabbed interface use the "
        },
        {
          "text": "<Tabs>",
          "marks": [
            "code"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " and "
        },
        {
          "text": "<TabItem>",
          "marks": [
            "code"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " components. Tabs are useful for grouping equivalent information where a user only needs to see one of several options."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ed545f12ea56",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Preview"
        }
      ]
